#ASSERT `Does the consent given for me have effect` `T` `special` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does the consent given for me have effect` `G` `minor` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

